@startuml
title Sequence - UC-16 Xác thực và uỷ quyền (OAuth2/OIDC - Authorization Code with PKCE)
actor "User" as User
participant "Client App/Web" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "IdP (Google/Azure)" as IdP
collections "Resource Servers" as ResourceServer

User -> Client : Interact

Client -> API: Request protected resource
API -> Auth: Verify token

alt No token or invalid token
  Auth --> API: Invalid token
  API --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
  Client -> Client : Generate code_verifier, code_challenge(S256), state, nonce
  Client -> IdP : Authorization Request\n(response_type=code, code_challenge, code_challenge_method=S256,\n state, nonce, redirect_uri)
  IdP --> User : Login form
  User -> IdP : Enter credentials / consent
  IdP --> Client : Redirect back with code, state (to redirect_uri)
  Client -> IdP : Token Exchange\n(grant_type=authorization_code, code, code_verifier, redirect_uri)
  IdP --> Client : id_token, access_token, refresh_token
  Client -> API : Relay request protected resource \nAuthorization: Bearer access_token?
  API -> Auth : Verify token
end
Auth --> API: Valid token
API -> ResourceServer : Delegate request
ResourceServer --> API : Response
API --> Client : 200 OK + resource
Client --> User : Response
@enduml